  "instance_name": "resilience_and_enduring_truth",
  "label": "Concept of enduring truth and resilience in the face of adversity",
  "description": "This is a philosophical and cultural concept that underpins the meme's message. It refers to the idea that certain truths, values, or messages are so fundamental that they cannot be destroyed or erased, even if the people who convey them are silenced or killed. This concept is often invoked in political movements, religious communities, and social justice causes. The image of Jesus on the cross, combined with the text, visually and textually reinforces this idea of resilience.",
